# .NET build artifacts — fixtures get compiled by the e2e harness or a local `dotnet build`.
# Never commit them (the session that added dotnet-greenfield leaked an obj/ tree locally).
# ** (not *) so a nested project layout (e.g. dotnet-nested/src/Svc/) is covered too, not just
# a flat fixtures/<project>/ layout.
**/bin/
**/obj/
